"[Selenium Webdriver using AT-SPI](https://invent.kde.org/sdk/selenium-"
"webdriver-at-spi) (currently in testing for [Season of KDE 2023](https://dot."
"kde.org/2023/01/23/season-kde-2023-mentees-and-projects))"
msgstr ""
"[Selenium Webdriver utilizzando AT-SPI](https://invent.kde.org/sdk/selenium-"
"webdriver-at-spi) (attualmente in fase di test per [Season of KDE 2023]"
"(https://dot.kde.org/2023/01/23/season-kde-2023-mentees-and-projects))"

